# AI token budget

## Do

- Record a dev measurement in `harness/platform/token-estimates/<feature>.md` before a production AI release.
- Set per-user, per-conversation, and per-call caps from that measurement.
- Wait for a written approval on that file.

## Do not

- Ship Workers AI, an AI Gateway route, or an external model connector to production without that file.
